	(gr_text_box "Notes:\n1. RF Trace width matched to 50 Ohms to 0.1765 mm\n   assuming Er=4.1 for JLC04161H-3313 Stackup\n   (Calculated using ADS and confirmed on PCBWAY)\n2. USB differential impedance of 90 Ohms done on\n   PCBWAY is 0.235 mm with separation of 0.25mm\n   based on JLC04161H-3313 Stackup\n3. RF trace via stitching  less than 2mm appart.\n4. UART pin-header anti-ringing resitors should be\n   placed close to the source MCU pins if placed.\n5. Edge of the PCB extended to allow for pin header\n   labels"
		(start 234.675 40.25)
		(end 312.125 78.35)
